# Redirects for Cloudflare (Workers static assets / Pages). One rule per line: from  to  status.
# The language root is handled by /index.html (meta refresh + navigator.language).
# When the old site's URL list is known, map every old path here with 301, e.g.:
# /about.html        /ru/about/        301
# /services.html     /ru/services/     301
# /news/*            /ru/blog/         301
/index.html   /   301
/ru           /ru/   301
/en           /en/   301
/uz           /uz/   301
